<section class="wrap page-heading prose">
  <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT THE SITE</p>

  <h1>A small project for learning Modern Greek.</h1>

  <p class="lede">
    Welcome to Talk Greek Today.
  </p>

  <p>
    I made this site to collect resources that I find useful while learning Modern Greek.
    It is a small project, and I hope you find it useful too.
  </p>

  <p>
    This site is a work in progress. I’ll add more lessons over time, along with links to other resources that I find helpful.
  </p>

  <p>
    I plan, organize, and check the lessons myself, and I use ChatGPT to help write them.
    We make a good team. I use Codex as a coding partner to build the website.
  </p>


  <p>
    I also maintain
    <a href="https://talktajiktoday.com/">Talk Tajik Today</a>,
    a collection of resources for learners of Tajik.
  </p>
